@@s024 At the exam
@@s025 When the question has <b>assignments with limits</b>, <b>disjoint paths</b> or a <b>minimum cut</b>, build a network and read the max flow. Phrase: <i>"Build a flow network with source s and sink t. Arc capacities encode the limits. By the integrality theorem there is an integral maximum flow of value k, which is the answer. Ford–Fulkerson runs in O(m·|f*|)."</i>
